{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233490","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233490","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1423349001:1":{"text":"芙拉贝尔！真想不到，远道而来的客人竟然是你！","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔！真想不到，远道而来的客人竟然是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916E7C437B410165","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423349002:1":{"text":"能再次见到你真是太高兴了！","source_cn":"能再次见到你真是太高兴了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BB31DCF800D821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423349003:1":{"text":"梅林大人，满满和漫漫！能再次见到你们，是我的幸运。","source_cn":"梅林大人，满满和漫漫！能再次见到你们，是我的幸运。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF03A079A17048FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"梅林大人，满满和漫漫！能再次见到你们，是我的幸运。","female":"梅林大人，满满和漫漫！能再次见到你们，是我的幸运。","variant_male_record_index":"171526","variant_female_record_index":"171527","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423349004:1":{"text":"可是芙拉贝尔你怎么会来萨洛克兰呢？你不在翡湖学院上课了吗？","source_cn":"可是芙拉贝尔你怎么会来萨洛克兰呢？你不在翡湖学院上课了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0018561366D167","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423349005:1":{"text":"最近刚好翡湖学院一学期的课程结束，进入了短暂的假期。","source_cn":"最近刚好翡湖学院一学期的课程结束，进入了短暂的假期。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC221B3FD4DA6CBCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423349006:1":{"text":"埃隆写信告诉了我们萨洛克兰发生的事，两千年前的过去，弥萨忒的诅咒，流亡他乡，居于地底的绿裔……","source_cn":"埃隆写信告诉了我们萨洛克兰发生的事，两千年前的过去，弥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5A8AF64EFB28C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423349007:1":{"text":"还有此处诅咒已经被解除这让人欣慰的消息。","source_cn":"还有此处诅咒已经被解除这让人欣慰的消息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC889DD451440990","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423349008:1":{"text":"于是，我就把萨洛克兰作为目的地，带着花灵们外出游学啦。","source_cn":"于是，我就把萨洛克兰作为目的地，带着花灵们外出游学啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB593073C11B213E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1423349008":{"text":"于是，我就把萨洛克兰作为目的地，带着花灵们外出游学啦。","source_cn":"于是，我就把萨洛克兰作为目的地，带着花灵们外出游学啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB593073C11B213E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423349009:1":{"text":"正是如此。艾塞勒是绿裔分支的一部分，但长久以来他们的存在一直被掩盖以至遗忘。","source_cn":"正是如此。艾塞勒是绿裔分支的一部分，但长久以来他们的存...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54AFC278A857BFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423349010:1":{"text":"我认为重新了解、教授、传承这些被遗忘的历史，是作为老师重要的工作。","source_cn":"我认为重新了解、教授、传承这些被遗忘的历史，是作为老师...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x116A6010A97B5594","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423349011:1":{"text":"而且我听说这里还有特殊的地底自然生态和钢心帝国的遗迹。","source_cn":"而且我听说这里还有特殊的地底自然生态和钢心帝国的遗迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE351B9E81902E062","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423349012:1":{"text":"一处地点同时汇集了如此丰富的知识与体验……不会有比这里更好的游学目的地了吧？","source_cn":"一处地点同时汇集了如此丰富的知识与体验……不会有比这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x718D8D74E13A9CFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423349013:1":{"text":"听起来很有道理！","source_cn":"听起来很有道理！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3D3623CC618388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1423349014:1":{"text":"芙拉贝尔，如果你想参观萨洛克兰的话，我们可以做你的向导哦！","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔，如果你想参观萨洛克兰的话，我们可以做你的向导哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6C0FB0B566ABEB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:14233490